{"reviewId": "388091364_870ZnsiVR", "review": {"abstract": "当技术创新刚被引入并带来效率提升时，较少的投入可以提供足额的产出，但当效率提升放缓时，为了保持原有的增速就需要更多的投资，这势必打破原有的平衡关系，使得供求发生较长时间的重构。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "那么目前25年和26年的上涨到底是属于哪种情况呢？是刚刚被引入ai效率提升的情况吗，康波周期末端还是前端，感觉经济还没好转，但是大宗商品又已经抢跑了。但是全面衰退出清又随时可能爆发，好难投资，像是走钢丝。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "16424-16512", "createTime": 1771428378, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "388091364_870ZnsiVR", "userVid": 388091364, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 388091364, "name": "山山", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/YsIttiaefQf6wib4iaWjQg00EI4I76jJDB9iaoO3czRribGchibu3haLHGKZ3fRbFdbTkXMzsc5cHTtuXpd2ApaUJudnQRs3GheOckmPImemb55Ac/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 420797, "name": "Kingsley", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELzRe4wzXVLrsSIUhZicLyhxdgUALgrTTUoy9ev4MXpp8ZEWUibpbJMlvwRxYhqesE7KCrSsn2MR4micGYZofzf1kH6Hegicfh62jKXp40icB4UjgQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc